OBS36 RETARGET - when a tree runs out, the crew must take the
  nearest surviving node of the SAME KIND within 8 cells, and
  give up if there is none. Never wood-to-food.
  Read by watching which node LOSES STOCK after the first is gone,
  because the crew's current node is private to Economy.
  same kind 3 cells away                     first node gone at 4.4s | moved to the wood node | still gathering=false
  same kind 12 cells away (outside radius)   first node gone at 4.4s | gave up | still gathering=false
  FOOD 3 cells away (wrong kind)             first node gone at 4.4s | gave up | still gathering=false
  nothing else on the map                    first node gone at 4.4s | gave up | still gathering=false

